  unitName: Thunder Eze
  unitId: 40012
  unitNumber: 14
  description: A warrior from the ruined Atharva Republic, he later became one of
    the Six Heroes. He trained hard until he developed the confidence to defeat large
    demons on his own. However, when he saw Princess Emilia fighting a demon, he
    realized how inexperienced he really was. After that, Eze sought out fights with
    other masters, hoping to unlock his own hidden powers.
  summonDesc: You heard my thunder!?<br>Some nerve you have, but still<br>I might
    as well help you!
  fusionDesc: Whoa!<br>No way! I'm even more<br>powerful than before!
  evoDesc: Where are my real enemies?!<br>Why do I have to waste my<br>time with
    these little bugs?
